{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49442","headline":"浣溪沙 七 · 薛昭藴","name":"浣溪沙 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倾国倾城恨有余，几多红泪泣姑苏，倚风凝睇雪肌肤。\n吴主山河空落日，越王宫殿半平芜，藕花菱蔓满平湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛昭藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}